:"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなすっごく仲良しだから団結力もすごくて、めーっちゃ楽しかった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにあみのクラスは、大阪名物たませんを売りました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪出身の方、知ってるかなぁ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょー美味しいんですよこれがまた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になった方は作り方簡単だから食べてみるべしっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまってた質問返しをやりまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.もし、あみちゃんが男性やったら、メンバーで、誰を彼女にしたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーとねえー、七瀬かまひろか飛鳥かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみのその面白い存在感はどこで磨かれたんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーわかんなーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別に面白くしてるつもりはないよおー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、俺は来週テストだけどあみもテスト？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あみはまだっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ勉強始めなきゃやばいっす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみはカラオケ好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし得意な曲、好きな曲があれば教えて下さい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あみの18番は、松田聖子さんの天子のウインクだよ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必ず歌うのさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみちゃんは将来のこととか決めたりしてるー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.うん、なんとなく自分の中の目標はあるよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、質問だけど、クリスマスとか冬休みは何か計画してますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.特に何もぉ～。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事だったら嬉しいね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、メンバーで憧れる子とかいる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んー...若月とか！すごい努力家なイメージがあるっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.でもそんなたくさんのファンに選抜入りお祝いされるのってどうよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.それは本当に嬉しい事だよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても幸せな気持ちになる！おめでとうっていっぱい言われると！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、質問とはちょっと違うけど、何か絵を書いて載せてちょうだいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うぅ。。わかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの最も苦手としている絵を皆様に今度お見せします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 愛未Ｔシャツ、何色が良い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ピンク！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、ぼく神奈川県のコンビ二（デイリー）でバイトしてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條さんにすげー似てる人が今日東スポ探しに来たんだけど本人？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.そう...かもしれないですね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりだあ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、バーベキューのキノコの話をしたけど記憶にあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーなんとなく覚えてるよお(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.まあやちゃんは美味しい？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ぷにぷにしてておいしいよ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、この五月から受験ってことで握手会は我慢してるけど、あみあみに会いたくてたまらん！どうするべきやと思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.でもさ、今は勉強を頑張らなきゃいけないのよね...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもずーっと勉強ばっかりなんて可哀想すぎる！たまには息抜きとしてあみの握手会来ても良いと思うよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、ぽこってゆうあだ名アレンジしてくださいっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ぽこりん！ぽこりんはいかが？？可愛い(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、秋の味覚は柿ですがwww冬に食べたいものは ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.冬かぁ～、みかんと海のカキだな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、握手会でどんな話が楽しいですか??ぶっちゃけちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはどんな話も楽しいよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方の事とかでも喜んで聴くしっ！お互いの趣味の話でもいんじゃない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、今１番ハマってる事や物や行為を教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ハマってることは人の目を見つめること！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみは「乃木どこ」の中でやってみたい企画とかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.なんだろーなー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰れま10的な事もやってみたいかも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.やっぱり握手会とか行ったほうがいいのかなあみあみどうおもう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うーん、あみは来て欲しい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみ族入会したい場合手続きいりますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.手続きなんかいらんっぺ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみのこと好きだ。って気づいた瞬間あなたはもう自動的にあみあみ族！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみは男装とか似合いそうだけど男装のコスプレってした事ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したいと思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うん、前したことあるよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男装のコスプレは嫌いじゃない！！むしろ好き(*^o^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみってなんでそんなに、目ぱっちりしてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.してないよまったく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと大きくぱっちりなりたい..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/6103335/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.おいシャン全握で俺と握手してるけど覚えてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.覚えてるに決まってるよおっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、彼氏いる子好きになったんですが